config FOGOS_LEGACY_AUDIO
	bool "Fogos legacy APR/Q6 audio techpack"
	depends on ARCH_QCOM && SND_SOC
	help
	  Build the Motorola fogos APR/Q6 audio stack. The vendor Holi build
	  configuration selects its modules independently of upstream audio.
	  Do not combine this with a GPR/SPF vendor audio stack.
